<Base title="About" description="Who runs FreelanceStack, how the guides are researched, and how the site makes money.">
  <h1>About FreelanceStack</h1>
  <p class="lede">Plain-English comparisons of the software freelancers use to find clients, do the work and get paid.</p>

  <h2>Who runs this site</h2>
  <p>FreelanceStack is run by Muhammad Shahbaz. I started it to help new freelancers choose tools without wading through confusing pricing pages and sales pitches.</p>

  <h2>How the guides are made</h2>
  <p>Each guide is based on the companies' own pricing and feature pages and on published comparisons. Where sources disagree, the article says so and tells you to check the official page before you buy. The research and drafting use AI tools, and the guides are published after review. I have not personally tested every tool listed.</p>

  <h2>How the site makes money</h2>
  <p>Some links on this site are affiliate links. If you sign up through one, I may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. This does not change what the guides say. Read the full <a href="/affiliate-disclosure">affiliate disclosure</a>.</p>

  <h2>Spotted a mistake?</h2>
  <p>Prices and plans change often. If something is out of date or wrong, please <a href="/contact">tell me</a> and I will fix it.</p>
</Base>
